message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. / Se usar este software, cite-o como abaixo."
title: "AmpliQA: open-source web app for planning and analysing RT-qPCR gene-expression experiments"
repository-code: "https://github.com/meriofilho/ampliqa"
url: "https://ampliqpcr.streamlit.app/"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Open-source web app for planning and analysing RT-qPCR gene-expression experiments, developed as a joint project
  of the Dalmolin Systems Biology Group (https://dalmolingroup.imd.ufrn.br/) and the Fish Lab - Laboratorio de Peixes
  (https://www.fishlabufrn.com/), Federal University of Rio Grande do Norte (UFRN), Brazil.
type: software
authors:
